        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Yoo Seung-ho\n- Works: Remember, The Magician, Seondal: The Man Who Sells the River, Ruler: Master of the Mask\n- Topics: Mandatory military service, South Korean film and television\n\nFacts:\n- Yoo Seung-ho returned to acting after completing two years of mandatory military service.\n- In 2015, Yoo Seung-ho headlined the legal drama Remember.\n- In 2015, Yoo Seung-ho starred in the historical film The Magician.\n- The Magician is a 2015 film.\n- In 2016, Yoo Seung-ho starred in the historical film Seondal: The Man Who Sells the River.\n- In 2017, Yoo Seung-ho starred in the historical drama Ruler: Master of the Mask.",
